{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'git diff --check && git diff -- game/games/lanterns/logic/src/lib.rs game/games/lanterns/app.contract game/games/lanterns/assets/lanterns-adapter.mjs game/games/lanterns/README.md game/games/lanterns/logic/tests/capture.rs'","aggregated_output":"diff --git a/game/games/lanterns/README.md b/game/games/lanterns/README.md\nindex 98f1be5..e8541d9 100644\n--- a/game/games/lanterns/README.md\n+++ b/game/games/lanterns/README.md\n@@ -3,7 +3,8 @@\n A three-minute third-person game built on Exact's game add-on. Move the animated\n Fox with WASD, arrows, or the left side of a touch screen. Jump with Space or the\n purple button and press E or LIGHT within 1.5 metres of a lantern. Push the crate\n-to reach the twelfth lantern on the ledge.\n+to reach the twelfth lantern on the ledge, then return within two horizontal\n+metres of the starting point before night falls.\n \n From the repository root:\n \ndiff --git a/game/games/lanterns/app.contract b/game/games/lanterns/app.contract\nindex 8f0bde0..cda5f55 100644\n--- a/game/games/lanterns/app.contract\n+++ b/game/games/lanterns/app.contract\n@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ shape Hud\n   total: number\n   remaining: number\n   phase: string\n+  returnHome: boolean\n \n component Lanterns\n   state started = false\n@@ -69,6 +70,8 @@ component Lanterns\n               text checkpointStatus aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"save-status\" padding=10 border-radius=9 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=14\n           text \"Move: WASD / arrows / left thumb\" position=\"absolute\" bottom=22 left=22 padding=12 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#d6cdec\" font-size=15\n           text \"Push the crate beside the high ledge. Jump onto it, then jump again.\" testId=\"sign-instruction\" position=\"absolute\" bottom=76 left=22 right=22 padding=12 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=14\n+          when hud.returnHome\n+            text \"All twelve are lit — return home before night!\" aria-live=\"assertive\" testId=\"return-home\" position=\"absolute\" top=90 left=\"25%\" width=\"50%\" padding=16 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#ffd27a\" color=\"#241531\" text-align=\"center\" font-size=20 font-weight=700\n           row position=\"absolute\" bottom=22 right=22 gap=14 align-items=\"flex-end\"\n             button press=light testId=\"light\" width=92 height=92 display=\"flex\" border-radius=46 background-color=\"#ffb43b\" justify-content=\"center\" align-items=\"center\"\n               text \"LIGHT\" width=\"100%\" text-align=\"center\" color=\"#241531\" font-size=17 font-weight=700\n@@ -83,7 +86,7 @@ component Lanterns\n           when hud.phase == \"won\"\n             column testId=\"victory\" position=\"absolute\" top=\"28%\" left=\"24%\" width=\"52%\" padding=30 align-items=\"center\" gap=18 border-radius=14 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n               text \"The island is glowing\" aria-live=\"polite\" font-size=34 color=\"#ffd27a\" font-weight=700\n-              text \"All twelve lanterns are lit.\" font-size=18 color=\"#fff4d6\"\n+              text \"All twelve lanterns are lit, and the fox made it home.\" font-size=18 color=\"#fff4d6\" text-align=\"center\"\n               button press=restart testId=\"again\" padding=16 border-radius=9 background-color=\"#ffd27a\"\n                 text \"Play again\" font-size=19 color=\"#241531\"\n           when hud.phase == \"lost\"\n@@ -95,7 +98,7 @@ component Lanterns\n         else\n           column testId=\"title\" position=\"absolute\" top=0 left=0 width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" align-items=\"center\" justify-content=\"center\" gap=24 background-color=\"#130f24\"\n             text \"LANTERNS\" font-size=64 font-weight=700 color=\"#ffd27a\"\n-            text \"Light twelve lanterns before the last three minutes of dusk run out.\" font-size=20 color=\"#fff4d6\"\n+            text \"Light